{"sha": "ece4c67d559d7690f1cbd5d9255893728ad1e70e78dc7b45d2f5ac44c8536e58", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g12:seq} 章 --- 数列}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:seq:1}", "设 $P(n)$ 为命题 $\\sum_{k=1}^{n} k^2 = \\frac{n(n+1)(2n+1)}{6}$。", "\\emph{基础情形：}当 $n = 0$ 时，两边都等于 $0$（空和）。", "\\emph{归纳步骤：}假设 $P(n)$ 成立，则", "\\[", "\\sum_{k=1}^{n+1} k^2 = \\frac{n(n+1)(2n+1)}{6} + (n+1)^2", "= \\frac{(n+1)\\bigl(n(2n+1) + 6(n+1)\\bigr)}{6}", "= \\frac{(n+1)(2n^2 + 7n + 6)}{6}.", "\\]", "由 $2n^2 + 7n + 6 = (n+2)(2n+3)$，上式即为", "$\\frac{(n+1)(n+2)(2(n+1)+1)}{6}$，即 $P(n+1)$。由归纳法，$P(n)$", "对所有 $n$ 成立。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:seq:2}", "$a_{n+1} - a_n = \\frac{n+2}{n+1} - \\frac{n+1}{n}", "= \\frac{n(n+2) - (n+1)^2}{n(n+1)} = \\frac{-1}{n(n+1)} < 0$，故 $(a_n)$", "严格递减。", "", "$(b_n)$ 各项为正，且", "$\\frac{b_{n+1}}{b_n} = \\frac{2^{n+1}}{n+1}\\cdot\\frac{n}{2^n} =", "\\frac{2n}{n+1} \\geq 1 \\iff 2n \\geq n+1 \\iff n \\geq 1$，故 $(b_n)$", "递增（$n \\geq 2$ 时严格）。", "", "$c_{n+1} - c_n = (n+1)^2 - 10(n+1) - n^2 + 10n = 2n - 9$，", "当 $n \\leq 4$ 时为负，当 $n \\geq 5$ 时为正：$(c_n)$ 先递减", "至 $c_5 = -25$（最小值），此后递增。它不单调。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:seq:3}", "提出主导项：", "\\[", "u_n = \\frac{n^2(3 - 1/n + 1/n^2)}{n^2(2 + 5/n^2)} \\xrightarrow[n\\to+\\infty]{} \\frac{3}{2}.", "\\]", "乘以共轭根式：", "\\[", "v_n = \\frac{(n+1) - n}{\\sqrt{n+1} + \\sqrt{n}} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{n+1}+\\sqrt{n}}", "\\xrightarrow[n\\to+\\infty]{} 0.", "\\]", "分子分母同除以 $3^n$：", "\\[", "w_n = \\frac{(2/3)^n - 1}{1 + (1/3)^n} \\xrightarrow[n\\to+\\infty]{} \\frac{0-1}{1+0} = -1,", "\\]", "利用 $\\lim q^n = 0$（当 $\\abs{q} < 1$ 时）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:seq:4}", "$u_n = 5 + 3n \\to +\\infty$，且 $v_n = 8 \\cdot (1/2)^n = 2^{3-n} \\to 0$。", "其部分和为", "\\[", "\\sum_{k=0}^{n} u_k = (n+1)\\,\\frac{5 + (5+3n)}{2} = \\frac{(n+1)(10+3n)}{2}", "\\xrightarrow[n\\to+\\infty]{} +\\infty,", "\\]", "\\[", "\\sum_{k=0}^{n} v_k = 8\\,\\frac{1 - (1/2)^{n+1}}{1 - 1/2}", "= 16\\left(1 - \\left(\\tfrac{1}{2}\\right)^{n+1}\\right)", "\\xrightarrow[n\\to+\\infty]{} 16 .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:seq:5}", "由 $-1 \\leq \\cos n \\leq 1$，", "\\[", "\\frac{n-1}{n+1} \\leq \\frac{n + \\cos n}{n+1} \\leq 1,", "\\]", "且 $\\frac{n-1}{n+1} \\to 1$，由夹逼定理，极限为 $1$。", "", "对第二个极限，写作", "\\[", "0 \\leq \\frac{n!}{n^n}", "= \\frac{1}{n}\\cdot\\frac{2}{n}\\cdots\\frac{n}{n}", "\\leq \\frac{1}{n},", "\\]", "因为每个因子 $\\frac{k}{n}$（$2 \\leq k \\leq n$）都不超过 $1$。", "由 $\\frac1n \\to 0$，夹逼定理给出 $\\frac{n!}{n^n} \\to 0$。（", "题目提示的几何估计同样可行：当 $k \\leq n/2$ 时，每个因子至多为", "$\\frac12$，从而得到更强的界 $(1/2)^{\\floor{n/2}}$。）", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:seq:6}", "\\emph{1.} $u_0 = 0 \\in \\intcc{0}{2}$。若 $0 \\leq u_n \\leq 2$，则", "$2 \\leq u_n + 2 \\leq 4$，故 $\\sqrt{2} \\leq u_{n+1} \\leq 2$；特别地", "$0 \\leq u_{n+1} \\leq 2$。由归纳法，该性质对所有 $n$ 成立。", "", "\\emph{2.} $u_{n+1} - u_n = \\sqrt{u_n + 2} - u_n$。对 $x \\in \\intcc{0}{2}$，", "$\\sqrt{x+2} \\geq x \\iff x + 2 \\geq x^2 \\iff (2-x)(x+1) \\geq 0$，显然成立。", "因此 $(u_n)$ 递增。", "", "\\emph{3.} 递增且以 $2$ 为上界的数列 $(u_n)$ 收敛于某个", "$\\ell \\in \\intcc{0}{2}$。在 $u_{n+1} = \\sqrt{u_n + 2}$ 中取极限", "（映射 $x \\mapsto \\sqrt{x+2}$ 连续），得 $\\ell = \\sqrt{\\ell + 2}$，", "故 $\\ell^2 - \\ell - 2 = 0$，即 $\\ell \\in \\{-1, 2\\}$。由 $\\ell \\geq 0$，所以", "$\\lim u_n = 2$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:seq:7}", "\\emph{1.} 两次服药之间有 $40\\%$ 的药物被排出，因此", "药量 $u_n$ 变为 $0.6\\,u_n$；下一次服药增加 $1$ 个单位：", "$u_{n+1} = 0.6\\,u_n + 1$.", "", "\\emph{2.} $v_{n+1} = u_{n+1} - 2.5 = 0.6\\,u_n + 1 - 2.5 = 0.6(u_n - 2.5)", "= 0.6\\,v_n$：$(v_n)$ 为公比 $0.6$ 的等比数列，首项", "为 $v_0 = 1 - 2.5 = -1.5$。由此 $v_n = -1.5 \\times 0.6^n$，且", "\\[", "u_n = 2.5 - 1.5 \\times 0.6^n .", "\\]", "", "\\emph{3.} 由 $0.6^n \\to 0$，得 $u_n \\to 2.5$：药物量稳定在", "$2.5$ 个单位。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}